Hi,

A few things you can check out first:

Are the abundances estimated with NB realistic for your species?

You should not be getting an observed chi-square of 0 unless your model
fits perfectly, which is unlikely. Do you get any warnings when fitting
the model with different distributions?

Do you get a value of 0 when using Nmix.chisq( ) on your model object?

Marc

